  "description": "The Great Divide Rim is where No. 22 started — our original road model, kept alive for riders who love the mechanical simplicity of a rim-brake bike. With generous tire clearance for a rim-brake bike thanks to our No. 6 Composites fork, you can have both the extra compliance and rolling efficiencies larger tires offer paired with the legendary road feel that only titanium can provide.\n\nThe Great Divide Rim offers a clean, modern approach to a road rim frame with a tapered head tube designed for integrated bearings, and a rear brake hose routed through the frame to keep external cables to a minimum. Finished-off with our bespoke drop-outs, brake bridge, and Ti headset, it's a rolling showcase of titanium purity. If you'd like this ride with disc brakes and room for bigger tires, see the Great Divide Disc.\n\nFULLY BUTTED TUBE SET TO SHAVE GRAMS AND TUNE THE RIDE QUALITY\n\nCUSTOM MACHINED TITANIUM HEAD TUBES AND HEAD SETS FOR PRECISE HANDLING AND A SEAMLESS LOOK\n\nCUSTOM MACHINED TITANIUM HEADSETS COMPLETE WITH ENDURO STAINLESS BEARINGS ARE NOW A STANDARD OFFERING ON ALL FRAMESETS.\n\nCUSTOM MODEL SPECIFIC FINISHING\n\nPROPRIETY CNC MACHINED GRADE 5 TITANIUM DROPOUTS\n\nLIGHTWEIGHT NO. 6 COMPOSITES CARBON FORK INCREASES TIRE CLEARANCE WHILE MAINTAINING PERFORMANCE ORIENTED GEOMETRY\n\nT47 BOTTOM BRACKET FOR MAXIMUM STIFFNESS AND A TIME-TESTED THREADED INTERFACE\n\nCUSTOM MACHINED BRAKE BRIDGE\n\nA FULL ARRAY OF NO. 22 | PROTOTIPO WORKS BESPOKE HARDWARE\n\nCUSTOM MACHINED TITANIUM HEADSETS SEAT POST COLLAR",
